{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o072a","title":"曹操东征刘备并擒夏侯博","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o072a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操判断袁绍不会立即进兵，在郭嘉支持下东征刘备，擒夏侯博并获刘备妻子，刘备逃奔袁绍。","evidence":["wudi-e-o072a-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o018a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"建安五年曹操东征，刘备败走青州，其众及妻子被收，关羽被擒。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o018a-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-e-p017a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"《魏书》称刘备以为曹操受制官渡，闻亲征尚未相信，亲察旗帜后弃众而走。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p017a-q"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-6630a856c0e1c1c96a1c","label":"裴注·《傅子》","text":"郭嘉劝急击刘备曹操东征备败奔袁绍","evidence":["chengguo-q-a1b6fb223eb63820eaeb"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-4db1087823d6d238c688","label":"正文","text":"曹操自征刘备","evidence":["chengguo-q-6ceb4f07633aafe149ba"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"东征","evidence":["wudi-e-o072a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0144","role":"劝征","evidence":["wudi-e-o072a-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"战败逃亡","evidence":["wudi-e-o072a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0171","role":"被擒","evidence":["wudi-e-o072a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0052","role":"刘备投奔对象","evidence":["wudi-e-o072a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0172","role":"被擒","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o018a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"建安五年","year":200,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o072a-q","wudi-q-o071","wudi-q-b-9900125064e5d85f08ad"],"chronology":"wudi-y200","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o071","basis":"建安五年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,402,"O072a"],"order":175}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0052","name":"袁绍","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0144","name":"郭嘉","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0171","name":"夏侯博","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0172","name":"关羽","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-6ceb4f07633aafe149ba","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-546398c9e99f491661e8","layer":"original","quote":"太祖自征备，","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":79,"end":85},{"id":"chengguo-q-a1b6fb223eb63820eaeb","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-d93e1e4c4c6e6b5a9d4a","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖欲速征刘备。议者惧军出，袁绍击其后，进不得战而退失所据。语在《武纪》。太祖疑，以问嘉。嘉劝太祖曰：‘绍性迟而多疑，来必不速；备新起，众心未附，急击之必败：此存亡之机，不可失也。’太祖曰：‘善。’遂东征备。备败奔绍，绍果不出","attribution":"裴注·《傅子》","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f84e0c2eef1f10e0b58a","start":10,"end":123},{"id":"wudi-e-o072a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-27a4f6d4ec7d03ce2963","layer":"original","quote":"公将自东征备，诸将皆曰：“与公争天下者，袁绍也。今绍方来，而弃之东；绍乘人后〖2〗，若何？”公曰：“夫刘备，人杰也。今不击，必为后患！﹝一﹞袁绍虽有大志，而见事迟；必不动也。”郭嘉亦劝公，遂东击备。破之，生擒其将夏侯博。备走，奔绍；获其妻子。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":121},{"id":"wudi-q-b-9900125064e5d85f08ad","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9900125064e5d85f08ad","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：建安五年（公元 200）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-744e4aee7f5ff14cca85","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o071","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c9f735ddad48a8f5c2b6","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月〖1〗，董承等谋泄，皆伏诛。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o018a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-ad5eaaeb0ac8302cb92c","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖9〗，曹公东征先主，先主败绩。﹝五﹞曹公尽收其众，虏先主妻子；并擒关羽以归。先主走青州。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"xianzhu-e-p017a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-fdb8cbb64501a6156444","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝五﹞《魏书》曰：“是时，公方有急于官渡；乃分留诸将屯官渡，自勒精兵征备。备初谓公与大敌连，不得东；而候骑猝至，言‘曹公自来’；备大惊。然犹未信，自将数十骑出望公军，见麾旌，便弃众而走。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":89,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-40ebcfa13d8f99e86319","start":0,"end":94}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
